AUDIO: 'person with an animal, currently work better with the original V1 Laura. So, we\'ll be testing both versions where appropriate. Now, before we get too excited, it\'s important to remember that this is not an official Creal AI'

[01:34] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'release. It\'s a community-fine-tuned built on top of Creal 2, and because it\'s trained using a dual conditioning approach, it requires the custom ComfyUI Creal 2 Edit node. In today\'s video, we\'ll set up the workflow, explain the'

[01:48] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'recommended settings, and then put this Laura through a variety of real-world editing tests. We\'ll see how well it preserves identity, performs local edits, changes clothing, removes and replaces objects, restyles images, and'

